      <h1 class="page-title post-title reveal">M&amp;A Market Outlook: Fewer, Bigger and Harder to Clear</h1>
      <p class="page-lede reveal">Deal activity has shifted towards larger, strategically significant acquisitions &mdash; and completing them now takes considerably more planning.</p>
      <p class="post-meta reveal"><time datetime="2026-08-15">15 August 2026</time></p>
    </div>
  </section>

